2025-01-17 -- 2025-10-25 workflow:
    1) Open Melody's GSheet and copy/paste entire contents into Excel. 
        a) https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Wnz4zIbEXtUZUYQLiCw4H3M0yul581o0XxGtDisgKnc/edit?gid=1407101405#gid=1407101405
    2) File - Options - Advanced - Editing Options
        a) Uncheck Use system separators
        b) Decimal separator: ,
        c) Thousands separator: .
    3) Save as CSV (UTF-8)
    4) Open Github for Desktop
    5) Open the repository in your external editor (VS Code)
    6) Copy csv into project folder, rename to DHAI_Referral_Guide.csv
    7) Update Updated Date
    8) Save/Commit the files
    9) Sync Changes so they are available on the internet and not just my local PC
        a) check status of publication to gh-pages here: https://github.com/patrickdo/referralbinder
        b) https://patrickdo.github.io/referralbinder/

